; The one variable: whether a SpriteFrames frame that is an AtlasTexture draws the region it names.
; The sheet's quadrants differ, so a wrong window is a different picture. No other golden reaches
; the atlas decode through SpriteFrames, whose pools differ from a plain Texture2D slot's.

